+ * Temperature sensors of Qualcomm remote processors, read over the QMI
+ * Thermal Sensor (TS) service.
+ *
+ * The modem owns thermistors next to its power amplifiers and RF front end
+ * and reports them through QMI service 0x17. Each sensor becomes a thermal
+ * zone sensor whose id is its index in qmi_ts_names[] plus the instance id
+ * of the remote processor, as in the Qualcomm downstream qmi_sensors driver
+ * this is based on.
